ory, in the order we lived them. Scroll to ride from the night we met to the wedding day, or tap a station to jump ahead.</span></p></div></section><section class=\"bd-ride\" data-mode=\"flat\" data-line=\"red\" aria-labelledby=\"ride-title\" style=\"--stops:7;--step-factor:0.9;--dwell:0.6\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Ride the Sara + Tyler Line\"><div class=\"bd-ride__rail\"><div class=\"bd-ride__stage\"><header class=\"bd-ride__head\" data-bl-k=\"header\" data-bl-label=\"Ride the Sara + Tyler Line\"><h2 id=\"ride-title\" class=\"bd-ride__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Ride the </span><span class=\"bd-nowrap\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Sara + Tyler Line</span></span></h2></header><nav class=\"bd-ride-map\" aria-label=\"Stations on the Sara + Tyler Line\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"nav\" data-bl-label=\"Stations on the Sara + Tyler Line\"><div class=\"bd-ride-map__viewport\"><ol class=\"bd-ride-map__list\"><li class=\"bd-ride-map__stop\" data-kind=\"origin\" data-line=\"red\"><a class=\"bd-ride-map__link\" href=\"#how-we-met\" aria-label=\"How we met\" target=\"_self\"><span class=\"bd-ride-map__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></span><span class=\"bd-ride-map__name\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">How we met</span></span></a></li><li class=\"bd-ride-map__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"blue\"><a class=\"bd-ride-map__link\" href=\"#the-connection\" aria-label=\"The connection\" target=\"_self\"><span class=\"bd-ride-map__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></span><span class=\"bd-ride-map__name\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">The connection</span></span></a></li><li class=\"bd-ride-map__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"brown\"><a class=\"bd-ride-map__link\" href=\"#our-life-together\" aria-label=\"Our life together\" target=\"_self\"><span class=\"bd-ride-map__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></span><span class=\"bd-ride-map__name\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our life together</span></span></a></li><li class=\"bd-ride-map__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"pink\"><a class=\"bd-ride-map__link\" href=\"#love\" aria-label=\"Love\" target=\"_self\"><span class=\"bd-ride-map__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></span><span class=\"bd-ride-map__name\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Love</span></span></a></li><li class=\"bd-ride-map__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"green\"><a class=\"bd-ride-map__link\" href=\"#greater-together\" aria-label=\"Greater together than alone\" target=\"_self\"><span class=\"bd-ride-map__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></span><span class=\"bd-ride-map__name\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Greater together than alone</span></span></a></li><li class=\"bd-ride-map__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"orange\"><a class=\"bd-ride-map__link\" href=\"#the-proposal\" aria-label=\"The proposal\" target=\"_self\"><span class=\"bd-ride-map__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></span><span class=\"bd-ride-map__name\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">The proposal</span></span></a></li><li class=\"bd-ride-map__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"gold\"><a class=\"bd-ride-map__link\" href=\"#what-marriage-means\" aria-label=\"What marriage means to us\" target=\"_self\"><span class=\"bd-ride-map__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></span><span class=\"bd-ride-map__name\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">What marriage means to us</span></span></a></li><li class=\"bd-ride-map__train\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></li></ol></div></nav><div class=\"bd-ride__window\"><ol class=\"bd-ride__track\" aria-label=\"Sara + Tyler Line, in order\"><li id=\"how-we-met\" class=\"bd-ride__stop\" data-kind=\"origin\" data-line=\"red\" style=\"--i:0\"><div class=\"bd-ride__platform\"><article class=\"bd-stopcard bd-stopcard--chapter\" aria-labelledby=\"how-we-met-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"How we met\"><span id=\"allison-and-jamies-wedding\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div class=\"bd-stopcard__text\"><p class=\"bd-stopcard__meta\"><span class=\"bd-stopcard__bullet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">one</span></span></p><h3 id=\"how-we-met-title\" class=\"bd-stopcard__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How we met</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We met at Allison and Jamie’s wedding, at a celebration for friends we cared about. Neither of us was looking for a relationship, but we hit it off almost immediately—flirty glances across the room, then an evening of talking, playing games, and getting to know each other. Before the night was over, Tyler asked Sara out, and a new chapter began.</span></p></div><p class=\"bd-prov bd-prov--own\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></p></div><figure class=\"bd-stopcard__media\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22576%22%20height%3D%22431%22%2F%3E\" width=\"911\" height=\"683\" alt=\"A wedding reception table set with roses, glassware and white chair covers.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture><span class=\"bd-stopcard__standin\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photo</span></span></figure></article></div></li><li id=\"the-connection\" class=\"bd-ride__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"blue\" style=\"--i:1\"><div class=\"bd-ride__platform\"><article class=\"bd-stopcard bd-stopcard--chapter\" aria-labelledby=\"the-connection-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"The connection\"><span id=\"museum-of-ice-cream\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"richardson-farm\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"michael-jordans-steakhouse\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"food-tastings\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"gardening-together\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div class=\"bd-stopcard__text\"><p class=\"bd-stopcard__meta\"><span class=\"bd-stopcard__bullet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">two</span></span></p><h3 id=\"the-connection-title\" class=\"bd-stopcard__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">The connection</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our first date was mini golf, a walk along the river, and sharing plates at The Cheesecake Factory. We were curious about each other, and with every conversation we found another reason to want to know more. By our fourth date, something had shifted. We ended the evening at Michael Jordan’s Steak House, laughing and smiling throughout dinner. When Tyler dropped Sara off at the train, we both knew this was something special. Along the way we kept finding places that felt like ours—the Museum of Ice Cream, Richardson Farm, food tastings, and time gardening together.</span></p></div><p class=\"bd-prov bd-prov--own\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></p></div><section class=\"story-carousel bd-stopcard__carousel\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" aria-label=\"The connection\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"The connection\"><div class=\"story-carousel__viewport\"><ol class=\"story-carousel__track\" aria-live=\"off\" style=\"transform:translateX(-0%)\"><li id=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-slide-1\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-label-1\"><span id=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-label-1\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The connection</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">1</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span></span><figure class=\"bd-stopcard__media\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22576%22%20height%3D%22431%22%2F%3E\" width=\"911\" height=\"683\" alt=\"A scoop of raspberry sorbet in a cone, held up against a pale wall.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture><span class=\"bd-stopcard__standin\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photo</span></span></figure></li><li id=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-slide-2\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" inert=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-label-2\"><span id=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-label-2\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The connection</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">2</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span></span><figure class=\"bd-stopcard__media\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22576%22%20height%3D%22432%22%2F%3E\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" alt=\"White barns beyond a field of ripe grain under a grey sky.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture><span class=\"bd-stopcard__standin\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photo</span></span></figure></li><li id=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-slide-3\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" inert=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-label-3\"><span id=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-label-3\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The connection</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">3</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span></span><figure class=\"bd-stopcard__media\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22430%22%20height%3D%22287%22%2F%3E\" width=\"907\" height=\"680\" alt=\"A plated steak with greens beside wine glasses on a dark restaurant table.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture><span class=\"bd-stopcard__standin\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photo</span></span></figure></li><li id=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-slide-4\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" inert=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-label-4\"><span id=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-label-4\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The connection</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">4</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span></span><figure class=\"bd-stopcard__media\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22430%22%20height%3D%22287%22%2F%3E\" width=\"853\" height=\"640\" alt=\"Wine bottles and empty tasting glasses lined up on a wooden bar with tasting sheets.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture><span class=\"bd-stopcard__standin\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photo</span></span></figure></li><li id=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-slide-5\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" inert=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-label-5\"><span id=\"_R_6kqd5esneknelb_-label-5\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The connection</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span></span><figure class=\"bd-stopcard__media\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22430%22%20height%3D%22287%22%2F%3E\" width=\"909\" height=\"682\" alt=\"A garden harvest in a green tub: red potatoes, beets, courgettes and beans.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture><span class=\"bd-stopcard__standin\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photo</span></span></figure></li></ol></div><div class=\"story-carousel__controls\"><ul class=\"story-carousel__dots\" aria-label=\"The connection slides\"><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 1 of 5\" aria-current=\"true\"></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 2 of 5\"></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 3 of 5\"></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 4 of 5\"></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 5 of 5\"></button></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__pause\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Pause slideshow</span></button></div></section></article></div></li><li id=\"our-life-together\" class=\"bd-ride__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"brown\" style=\"--i:2\"><div class=\"bd-ride__platform\"><article class=\"bd-stopcard bd-stopcard--chapter\" aria-labelledby=\"our-life-together-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Our life together\"><div class=\"bd-stopcard__text\"><p class=\"bd-stopcard__meta\"><span class=\"bd-stopcard__bullet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">three</span></span></p><h3 id=\"our-life-together-title\" class=\"bd-stopcard__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Our life together</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Since then, we’ve built a life around curiosity, shared values, and a sense of adventure. We both love discovering new places, trying new restaurants, and sharing the things that excite us. Tyler is always ready to embrace an adventure and see where it takes us, while Sara brings a thoughtful perspective and notices the little things along the way. We balance each other in the best ways, encouraging one another to try new things, see different perspectives, and keep growing together. Whether we’re exploring somewhere new, tending to the garden, or enjoying our favorite traditions, we’re happiest experiencing life together.</span></p></div><p class=\"bd-prov bd-prov--own\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></p></div><span class=\"bd-stopcard__numeral\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">3</span></span></article></div></li><li id=\"love\" class=\"bd-ride__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"pink\" style=\"--i:3\"><div class=\"bd-ride__platform\"><article class=\"bd-stopcard bd-stopcard--chapter\" aria-labelledby=\"love-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Love\"><span id=\"madison-waterfront\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"starved-rock\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div class=\"bd-stopcard__text\"><p class=\"bd-stopcard__meta\"><span class=\"bd-stopcard__bullet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">four</span></span></p><h3 id=\"love-title\" class=\"bd-stopcard__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Love</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We said “I love you” for the first time at Starved Rock State Park. The Madison waterfront belongs in this chapter of our story too.</span></p></div><p class=\"bd-prov bd-prov--own\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></p></div><section class=\"story-carousel bd-stopcard__carousel\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" aria-label=\"Love\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Love\"><div class=\"story-carousel__viewport\"><ol class=\"story-carousel__track\" aria-live=\"off\" style=\"transform:translateX(-0%)\"><li id=\"_R_6oqd5esneknelb_-slide-1\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_6oqd5esneknelb_-label-1\"><span id=\"_R_6oqd5esneknelb_-label-1\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Love</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">1</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">2</span></span><figure class=\"bd-stopcard__media\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22576%22%20height%3D%22431%22%2F%3E\" width=\"911\" height=\"683\" alt=\"Bright red kayaks on a wooden dock at the edge of Lake Monona in Madison, Wisconsin.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture><span class=\"bd-stopcard__standin\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photo</span></span></figure></li><li id=\"_R_6oqd5esneknelb_-slide-2\" class=\"story-carousel__slide\" inert=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_6oqd5esneknelb_-label-2\"><span id=\"_R_6oqd5esneknelb_-label-2\" class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Love</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">: image </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">2</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> of </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">2</span></span><figure class=\"bd-stopcard__media\" data-bl-k=\"figure\" data-bl-label=\"Photo: hakkun, CC BY-SA 3.0 (this crop is shared\"><picture><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22576%22%20height%3D%22432%22%2F%3E\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" alt=\"French Canyon at Starved Rock State Park: sandstone walls and green trees around a narrow canyon.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture><span class=\"bd-stopcard__standin\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photo</span></span><figcaption class=\"bd-stopcard__credit\"><a class=\"bd-stopcard__license\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:French_Canyon_-_Starved_Rock_-_panoramio.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photo: hakkun, CC BY-SA 3.0 (this crop is shared under the same licence)</span></a></figcaption></figure></li></ol></div><div class=\"story-carousel__controls\"><ul class=\"story-carousel__dots\" aria-label=\"Love slides\"><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 1 of 2\" aria-current=\"true\"></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__dot\" aria-label=\"Show image 2 of 2\"></button></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"story-carousel__pause\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Pause slideshow</span></button></div></section></article></div></li><li id=\"greater-together\" class=\"bd-ride__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"green\" style=\"--i:4\"><div class=\"bd-ride__platform\"><article class=\"bd-stopcard bd-stopcard--chapter\" aria-labelledby=\"greater-together-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Greater together than alone\"><div class=\"bd-stopcard__text\"><p class=\"bd-stopcard__meta\"><span class=\"bd-stopcard__bullet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">five</span></span></p><h3 id=\"greater-together-title\" class=\"bd-stopcard__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Greater together than alone</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Now, we’re excited to keep growing together, build a family, and share many more adventures. To us, marriage is about more than the two of us. The people in our lives have helped shape who we are, and those experiences and relationships helped make us the people who found each other. We wouldn’t be who we are, or the couple we are today, without our family and friends.</span></p></div><p class=\"bd-prov bd-prov--own\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></p></div><figure class=\"bd-stopcard__media\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22576%22%20height%3D%22432%22%2F%3E\" width=\"921\" height=\"691\" alt=\"The Chicago skyline across Lake Michigan at sunrise, the sky pink and gold.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture><span class=\"bd-stopcard__standin\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photo</span></span></figure></article></div></li><li id=\"the-proposal\" class=\"bd-ride__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"orange\" style=\"--i:5\"><div class=\"bd-ride__platform\"><article class=\"bd-stopcard bd-stopcard--chapter\" aria-labelledby=\"the-proposal-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"The proposal\"><div class=\"bd-stopcard__text\"><p class=\"bd-stopcard__meta\"><span class=\"bd-stopcard__bullet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">six</span></span></p><h3 id=\"the-proposal-title\" class=\"bd-stopcard__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">The proposal</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our engagement was a love letter to the story we’d been building. Over the course of a summer, Tyler took Sara back to places that held special memories for us. When the day finally came, he surprised her with an indoor picnic surrounded by photos and mementos from our time together, celebrating the journey that brought us here and all the adventures still to come.</span></p></div><p class=\"bd-prov bd-prov--own\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></p></div><figure class=\"bd-stopcard__media\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22576%22%20height%3D%22432%22%2F%3E\" width=\"853\" height=\"640\" alt=\"A close-up of a pale pink diamond ring resting on sparkling beads.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture><span class=\"bd-stopcard__standin\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Stand-in photo</span></span></figure></article></div></li><li id=\"what-marriage-means\" class=\"bd-ride__stop\" data-kind=\"transfer\" data-line=\"gold\" style=\"--i:6\"><div class=\"bd-ride__platform\"><article class=\"bd-stopcard bd-stopcard--chapter\" aria-labelledby=\"what-marriage-means-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"What marriage means to us\"><div class=\"bd-stopcard__text\"><p class=\"bd-stopcard__meta\"><span class=\"bd-stopcard__bullet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"></span><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">seven</span></span></p><h3 id=\"what-marriage-means-title\" class=\"bd-stopcard__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What marriage means to us</span></h3><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">That’s why having you celebrate with us means so much. We’re bringing together the people who have been part of our stories, and we can’t think of a better way to begin this next chapter than surrounded by all of you.</span></p></div><p class=\"bd-prov bd-prov--own\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></p></div><span class=\"bd-stopcard__numeral\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">7</span></span></article></div></li></ol></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bd-places\" aria-labelledby=\"places-title\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Places that shaped us\"><div class=\"bd-places__intro\"><h2 id=\"places-title\" class=\"bd-places__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Places that shaped us</span></h2><p class=\"bd-places__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">A few of the places that shaped this story, and the adventures still to come.</span></p></div><ul class=\"bd-places__tiles\"><li class=\"bd-places__tile\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><a class=\"bd-places__link\" href=\"/our-adventures\"><picture class=\"bd-places__photo\" data-media=\"city.river\"><img src=\"/media/botanical-deco/city/river-640.avif\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 62%\" data-bl-m=\"art\"></picture><span class=\"bd-places__caption\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span class=\"bd-places__name\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Chicago</span></span><span class=\"bd-places__line\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">The river, the bridges, the lake.</span></span></span></a></li><li class=\"bd-places__tile\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><a class=\"bd-places__link\" href=\"/our-adventures/example\"><picture class=\"bd-places__photo\" data-media=\"place.starved-rock\"><img src=\"/media/botanical-deco/city/place-starved-rock-640.avif\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:45% 50%\" data-bl-m=\"art\"></picture><span class=\"bd-places__caption\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span class=\"bd-places__name\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Starved Rock</span></span><span class=\"bd-places__line\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Where “I love you” was said first.</span></span></span></a></li><li class=\"bd-places__tile\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><a class=\"bd-places__link\" href=\"/our-adventures\"><picture class=\"bd-places__photo\" data-media=\"city.north-pond\"><img src=\"/media/botanical-deco/city/north-pond-640.avif\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:45% 55%\" data-bl-m=\"art\"></picture><span class=\"bd-places__caption\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span class=\"bd-places__name\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Places ahead</span></span><span class=\"bd-places__line\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">More to explore together.</span></span></span></a></li></ul><p class=\"bd-places__action\"><a class=\"bd-btn bd-btn--primary bd-btn--moss\" href=\"/our-adventures\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Explore our favorite places</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></a></p><img class=\"bd-bloom bd-bloom--places\" src=\"/media/botanical-deco/botanical/vine-right-52.webp\" width=\"52\" height=\"590\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-media=\"botanical.vine-right\" data-bl-m=\"art\"></section></main><nav class=\"bd-bar\" aria-label=\"Quick actions\" style=\"--cells:2\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"nav\" data-bl-label=\"Quick actions\"><a class=\"bd-bar__cell\" href=\"/our-story\" aria-current=\"page\" data-bl-b=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 5h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4zM20 5h-7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7z\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Story</span></span></a><a class=\"bd-bar__cell\" href=\"/our-adventures\" data-bl-b=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 1 0 0-18 9 9 0 0 0 0 18zM15 9l-2 6-4 2 2-6z\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Adventures</span></span></a></nav><footer class=\"bd-footer\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl